0e379b4f-eeee-4abd-93eb-fc221dd1b330/acgr-replication-starter-pack__SEP__infra__SEP__stack.py: CloudWatch Logs policy grants overly broad permissions with wildcard resources. Quote: "lambda_role.add_to_policy(
            iam.PolicyStatement(
                actions=[
                    "logs:CreateLogGroup",
                    "logs:CreateLogStream",
                    "logs:PutLogEvents",
                ],
                resources=["*"],
            )
        )". While this enables access logging, the wildcard resource violates least privilege principles.

